        "title": "In the modern world, it is possible to shop, work and communicate with people via the Internet and live without any face-to-face contact with others. Is it a positive or negative development in your opinion?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lj7Ddf334oN3gUx2tJGliOz1gJc\"><em><strong>In the modern world, it is possible to shop, work and communicate with people via the Internet and live without any face-to-face contact with others. Is it a positive or negative development in your opinion?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Online Interaction Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RHAYd3s4EoxO01xZ1YzlPsr8gFc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Online Interaction Debate&nbsp;cho 1 xu hướng:</strong> Trong thế giới hiện đại, con người c&oacute; thể mua sắm, l&agrave;m việc v&agrave; giao tiếp với nhau qua Internet m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng cần tiếp x&uacute;c trực tiếp.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JJ3odfVHFoCNd8x8U0ZlEChAglf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Dạng c&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Theo bạn, đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một sự ph&aacute;t triển t&iacute;ch cực hay ti&ecirc;u cực?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FL7id1P5PoeP9GxtckAlXjQLgKc\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Online Interaction Debate v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAB3dnRwhoeC1Wx60mOlZ5Zkgsg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1: </strong>Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DFFwdCaMRo6xOJxKGselA3gxgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2: </strong>Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M6ordzij2ohuP6xzg5NlC85JgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sby4dG2mto9AQjxw9Ftlpp3tgHq\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>face-to-face interactions <em>(tương t&aacute;c trực tiếp)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AUxLdwnbKof5AxxE7qFlhlHMgTg\">\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n body:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">Bạn n&ecirc;n thảo luận mỗi quan điểm v&agrave; đưa ra &yacute; kiến c&aacute; nh&acirc;n của m&igrave;nh về việc ủng hộ quan điểm n&agrave;o. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong> với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass tin rằng <strong>'xu hướng n&agrave;y sẽ mang lại nhiều t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực hơn l&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực'. </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FlP8dXLBeomshVxHP6AlY4R3gPe\">&rarr; Với c&aacute;ch lập luận n&agrave;y, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 body như sau:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwZHdMQbZob6zoxhcHqlKybCgmg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 1:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; của xu hướng n&agrave;y.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZH0ldWR5VolMyMxXIa7lZMuwggg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Body 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E6xsduRXyo7PgoxfRdNlJsyWgCb\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCi8dUtrIoNNTTx7gl3llDpYgUL\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" target=\"_self\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jvy7dry7XoJRCyx1bgulj2smgZf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DqjpdMqWWoiZ5lxsEK7lpzBagSh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" target=\"_self\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></strong></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết Body 1: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về một số t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đ&aacute;ng ch&uacute; &yacute; m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y g&acirc;y ra.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFlOdn0L6o9tGSxuugml62PSg9d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6ABdum2roKdXNxQrTWlclq5gKd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, <em>sống ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n trực tuyến (living entirely online)</em> c&oacute; thể g&acirc;y ra một số vấn đề đ&aacute;ng lo ngại li&ecirc;n quan đến <em>sức khỏe x&atilde; hội (social well-being)</em> v&agrave; <em>khả năng giao tiếp (communication abilities).</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EOcldNuJpocXpGxtjDwl9gKHgNg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X4R7dnJ0po5z2PxzJ6rlhlfHgna\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1:</strong> Về vấn đề đầu ti&ecirc;n, những người <em>chỉ dựa v&agrave;o (rely solely on)</em> <em>tương t&aacute;c kỹ thuật số (digital interactions)</em> c&oacute; thể trải qua <em>sự c&ocirc; lập x&atilde; hội (social isolation)</em> v&agrave; c&ocirc; đơn, v&igrave; họ thiếu những <em>kết nối con người (human connections)</em> c&oacute; &yacute; nghĩa trong đời thực.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LTQvd4tTPoPGgbxusIAlt2eZgje\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Kết quả l&agrave;, điều n&agrave;y cuối c&ugrave;ng c&oacute; thể dẫn đến <em>c&aacute;c vấn đề về sức khỏe t&acirc;m thần (mental health problems)</em> như <em>trầm cảm (depression)</em> v&agrave; lo &acirc;u.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMeSdaVkPobEX1xPAs0lxBi7gCe\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EuyQdkYBRomqlkx2EV4ldUfZgZf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Về vấn đề thứ hai, những người <em>phụ thuộc ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n v&agrave;o (depend exclusively on)</em> <em>tin nhắn văn bản (text messages)</em> v&agrave; cuộc gọi video c&oacute; thể gặp kh&oacute; khăn trong việc ph&aacute;t triển <em>kỹ năng giao tiếp ph&ugrave; hợp (proper communication skills)</em>, đặc biệt l&agrave; trong việc đọc <em>ng&ocirc;n ngữ h&igrave;nh thể (body language)</em> v&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c t&iacute;n hiệu x&atilde; hội (social cues)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nvg5dr2aEoS2acxkYaalrvR9gCb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Do đ&oacute;, họ c&oacute; thể thấy kh&oacute; khăn khi phải đối ph&oacute; với <em>c&aacute;c t&igrave;nh huống gặp mặt trực tiếp (face-to-face situations)</em> trong tương lai.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết Body 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y về những t&aacute;c động t&iacute;ch cực đ&aacute;ng kể m&agrave; xu hướng n&agrave;y mang lại.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTcmdZobEoTmv6x3FLVlPSQfgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQk7dtFfcodO74x8BqAlUFO8gug\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin chắc rằng những lợi &iacute;ch của <em>lối sống kỹ thuật số (digital lifestyle)</em> n&agrave;y vượt trội hơn nhiều so với những lo ngại n&ecirc;u tr&ecirc;n.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AH82dEJY6ofAS4xaWyOl07ZBgcf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhytdhd6honbSgxhVzDlcdEEghg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Một lợi &iacute;ch quan trọng l&agrave; sự tiện lợi v&agrave; <em>khả năng tiết kiệm thời gian (time-saving aspect)</em> m&agrave; n&oacute; mang lại.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SxeldGqjioFVAjxG6nwlX4iogub\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact</strong>: Điều n&agrave;y l&agrave; do việc loại bỏ nhu cầu <em>đi lại (commute)</em> hoặc di chuyển để l&agrave;m việc v&agrave; <em>chạy việc vặt (errands)</em>, mọi người c&oacute; thể tiết kiệm được v&agrave;i giờ mỗi ng&agrave;y, điều n&agrave;y do đ&oacute; cho ph&eacute;p họ c&oacute; nhiều thời gian hơn cho <em>c&aacute;c hoạt động hiệu quả (productive activities)</em> v&agrave; <em>đạt được sự c&acirc;n bằng tốt hơn giữa c&ocirc;ng việc v&agrave; cuộc sống (achieving a better work-life balance)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xc15daCmootdJMxEE6IldYJJgIh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VdErdOE9KoFkTtx0QIaluJ4ygIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2</strong>: Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>sống trực tuyến (online living)</em> tạo điều kiện cho <em>kết nối to&agrave;n cầu (global connectivity)</em> v&agrave; <em>những cơ hội chưa từng c&oacute; (unprecedented opportunities)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AJqzdhj2HotQnVxzTc9l2aOug8c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason + Impact:</strong> Điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; nghĩa l&agrave; c&aacute;c c&aacute; nh&acirc;n giờ đ&acirc;y c&oacute; thể <em>kết nối với mọi người tr&ecirc;n to&agrave;n thế giới (connect with people worldwide)</em>, tiếp cận <em>thị trường việc l&agrave;m quốc tế (international job markets)</em><strong> </strong>v&agrave; học hỏi từ c&aacute;c nền văn h&oacute;a đa dạng, do đ&oacute; mở rộng <em>triển vọng nghề nghiệp (career prospects)</em> v&agrave; <em>khả năng gi&aacute;o dục (educational possibilities)</em> của họ <em>vượt ra ngo&agrave;i c&aacute;c giới hạn địa l&yacute; (beyond geographical limitations)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HhjYd198Qo0hYvxQQmNlpg7jg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZiDZdDL6GoLynJx2cO4lvJH3gZc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ESGvdSTMpokPXUx0z1JljlJcgRb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">hinder communication skill development <em>(cản trở sự ph&aacute;t triển kỹ năng giao tiếp)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1455,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UY1Od5N1SovQ8qxRpX9li7M3goX\">In the modern era, it has become feasible for individuals to conduct their daily activities such as shopping, working, and communicating entirely through the Internet without requiring face-to-face interactions. Although this development may lead to certain social drawbacks, I believe the convenience and global opportunities it offers are far more significant.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17813,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1456,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SlgvdRfeGob03sxkJdulbx0dg7d\"><strong>Admittedly, living entirely online can result in some concerning issues related to social well-being and communication abilities. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">Regarding the former, individuals who rely solely on digital interactions may experience social isolation and loneliness, as they lack meaningful human connections in real life. As a result, this can eventually lead to mental health problems such as depression and anxiety. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">As for the latter, people who depend exclusively on text messages and video calls may struggle to develop proper communication skills, particularly in reading body language and social cues. Consequently, they might find it challenging to navigate face-to-face situations in the future.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17813,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1457,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A3Gid2WdPomOebxdwl4l5NzIgug\"><strong>However, I am convinced that the advantages of this digital lifestyle far outweigh these concerns.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One significant benefit is the convenience and time-saving aspect it provides. This is because by eliminating the need to commute or travel for work and errands, people can save several hours daily, which consequently allows them more time for productive activities and achieving a better work-life balance. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, online living enables global connectivity and unprecedented opportunities. This means that individuals can now connect with people worldwide, access international job markets, and learn from diverse cultures, therefore expanding their career prospects and educational possibilities beyond geographical limitations.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17813,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1458,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PXredlxvBoN9qzxy4BylQSSfgfe\">In conclusion, while living without face-to-face contact may create social isolation and hinder communication skill development, I believe its benefits in terms of convenience and global opportunities are more substantial.</div>\n</div>",
